TERMS AND CONDITIONS FOR USE, REPRODUCTION, AND DISTRIBUTION

1. DEFINITIONS
"Software" refers to the source code, object code, documentation, machine learning models, and associated assets of the SenseBridge platform.
"Commercial Use" means using, integrating, deploying, sublicensing, distributing, or offering the Software (or any derivative work thereof) for monetary compensation, revenue generation, subscription fees, commercial licensing, or proprietary enterprise monetization.
"Healthcare Services" means medical care, clinical applications, hospital operations, patient rehabilitation, assistive health technologies for individuals with disabilities, and medical diagnostic or caregiving services.
"Charitable Causes" means non-profit, humanitarian, philanthropic, non-governmental (NGO), and donation-based public welfare initiatives whose primary objective is social good and accessibility assistance.

