Except as expressly provided in Subsections 3(b) and 3(c), any Commercial Use of the Software, in whole or in part, or in modified or derivative form, is STRICTLY PROHIBITED without prior express written permission from the copyright holders.

(b) HEALTHCARE AND MEDICAL SERVICES EXCEPTION:
Commercial Use IS PERMITTED and explicitly authorized for healthcare, medical, clinical, and assistive health-related applications. Hospitals, clinics, rehabilitation centers, medical device companies, and health practitioners may freely use, integrate, deploy, and provide services incorporating this Software for the diagnosis, safety, rehabilitation, caregiving, and assistance of patients and individuals with visual, auditory, or motor disabilities, without payment of licensing fees or royalties.

(c) CHARITABLE AND HUMANITARIAN EXCEPTION:
Commercial Use, fundraising, and donation-based operations ARE PERMITTED and explicitly authorized for recognized charities, non-profit entities, humanitarian missions, and philanthropic organizations. Such entities may collect donations, fundraise, and deploy the Software in public welfare programs dedicated to disability support, community accessibility, and social assistance without licensing fees or royalties.

